{"ID":"20230927161958-8r9ixbr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927161958-8r9ixbr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161958-8r9ixbr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927162001-un3a4yn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927162001-dhdbk5a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927162001-dhdbk5a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:123,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:123\u0026#125;","title":"川楝子","type":"doc","updated":"20230927162001"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927162001-un3a4yn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927162001-un3a4yn","updated":"20230927162001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川楝子是一味苦寒的药，我们治肝的药或者疏肝的药，基本很多都是比较会让肝变得比较干燥，那川楝子苦寒和疏肝效果是非常好的。"}]},{"ID":"20230927162001-dhdbk5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927162001-dhdbk5a","updated":"20230927162001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可是相对来说，它药性很寒，所以对脾胃之气是有破坏的，所以用川楝子剂量一定要低。川楝子大概现在临床上面是非常宝贵的药，就是那种肝癌啊，或者很严重的肝病，那种痛到很不能解决的痛，那是川楝子，实际上几乎是唯一的止痛药了。就是不通则痛，肝脏的痛是川楝子。"}]}]}